  "bio": "Ludvig Lewinsky is a masterful tattoo artist based in Stockholm, Sweden, renowned for his exquisite black and gray tattoos. His attention to cleanliness is impeccable, ensuring that every client experiences the highest standard of hygiene in his studio, Bad Mood Tattoo. Whether you're looking for expert tattooing or unique painting, Ludvig's artistry is matched by his dedication to a clean and safe tattooing environment.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Stockholm, Stockholm County, Sweden"
}